              "text": "implicar — \"to involve, to entail; to imply\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mudar de casa implica muito trabalho. Moving house involves a lot of work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Informally, implicar com alguém — to pick on someone."
            }
