          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "acarretar first meant \"to carry by cart\": it is built on carreta \"small cart\", from carro, inherited from Latin carrus \"a wagon\" (Lewis & Short)."
